 "remarks": "Turnkey living meets in-town convenience in this beautifully appointed three-bedroom townhouse, ideally located within easy walking distance of shops, restaurants, and local amenities. The open-concept main level features 9-foot ceilings, a welcoming fireplace, while French doors lead to a charming fenced patio and garden. The gourmet kitchen is beautifully equipped with Viking appliances and quartz countertops and flows seamlessly into the living and dining spaces. A private office or den with built-in cabinetry provides a dedicated work-from-home space. The upper level features a spacious primary suite with vaulted ceiling, walk-in closet, and spa-like bath, plus two additional bedrooms and a dedicated laundry room. A finished lower level with a newly added full bath provides flexible space for a playroom, recreation room, gym, or guests. Stylish, spacious, and move-in ready, this exceptional townhouse offers sophisticated living just moments from the heart of town. The HOA fee is calculated by the owner based on estimated monthly expenses for the front unit, with total association expenses shared between the two units. Please contact the listing agent for additional details.",
